  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place shrimp in a large glass or other non-reactive bowl; cover with lime juice to marinate (cook) until turn pink and opaque, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, combine tomatoes, avocados, celery, onion, and jalapeño in a separate large glass or other non-reactive bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove shrimp from lime juice; reserve juice. Dice shrimp; add to bowl with vegetables. Add reserved lime juice and cilantro; season with salt and black pepper. Toss gently to combine.",
